// @ts-check
// The ask bank: for every tool an agent may use, what a person says when that tool is the right first call. Written by authors who saw the tool's name and description (and its siblings in the
// catalog) and wrote ordinary words: short commands, questions, indirect problem statements, asks that avoid the tool's own words, long and sloppy ones. lib/tools-rank.js learns from them (the
// centroid, the closest ask and the word likelihood of each tool); lib/tools-index.js fuses that with the keyword ranking. Keyed by the name a tool is called with. test/tools-find-quality.test.js
// fails on a key that is no longer a tool and on a tool with fewer than three asks, so a rename or a new tool cannot leave the finder blind to it.

